  "limitations": [
    "Both versions have slow I/O samples. Before 256-MiB write samples are 59.77, 29.45 and 15.80 MiB/s; their median exaggerates the gain relative to the fastest baseline sample.",
    "After 64-MiB write samples are 86.45, 10.62 and 86.63 MiB/s. The slow run includes a 5.47-second write; it completes without a short write. Moving checkpoints does not remove storage stalls.",
